ved zero terminal-delegated schemas; the derivation is broken, not the package\")\n+\t}\n+\treturn delegated\n+}\n+\n+// contractVersionsByID projects one release's Section 1.5 contract registry\n+// into contract ID -> declared versions.\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"internal/canonicaljson/record_conformance_test.go","added":31,"removed":2},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
